NOTE ON CONTENT. The transcripts are synthetic. Every "user" turn was
generated by a language model role-playing a scripted persona; no real user
data, and no personal data of any kind, is contained in this release. The
transcripts do contain simulated expressions of loneliness, grief, and
emotional dependence, and target-model responses that reinforce them. They
are published as an audit instrument, not as training data for companion
systems.
